      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, existing policy of the City, enunciated by the New York City Collective Bargaining Law, seeks to promote harmonious relations between the City and its employees by providing machinery for the conduct of collective bargaining negotiations, for the orderly presentation and redress of employee grievances, and by recognizing the right of employees to speak through designated representatives in other areas of employer-employee interest, and",
